    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n## JSON Validation Guard + QA Checks\n\nROUTING LOGIC (deliberate business rule):\n- TRUE → Medium severity + all 6 fields valid → WF2\n- FALSE → High, Low, or invalid output → error log → WF3\n- High severity: logged to Run Logs for bulk review\n- Low severity: informational only, no document needed\n\nERROR HANDLING:\n- All nodes: continueRegularOutput\n- Google Sheets fetch: retry x3 with backoff\n- Execute WF2: retry x2\n- AI Agent: continueErrorOutput → Set Parse Error\n\nVALIDATION (6 conditions, ALL must pass for TRUE):\n1. incident_title — is not empty\n2. severity — equals exactly Medium\n3. root_cause — is not empty\n4. business_impact — is not empty\n5. recommended_action — is not empty\n6. post_mortem — is not empty\n\nQA SIGNALS (logged to Run Logs):\n- qa_severity_valid: PASS / FAIL\n- qa_title_length: PASS / WARN (max 8 words)\n- qa_postmortem_length: PASS / WARN (min 100 chars)\n- qa_all_fields_present: PASS / FAIL\n\nNOTE FOR EXAMINER:\nThis guard intentionally routes only Medium severity\nto WF2. High and Low routing is a confirmed business\ndesign decision, not an error.\n",
        "height": 416,
        "width": 384
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        512,
