    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "\n## WF1 — Data Ingestion & AI Analysis\nARIA — Automated Incident Response System v2.0\n\nWORKFLOW PURPOSE:\nReads pending incidents from Google Sheets every hour,\nruns AI triage using ARIA, validates the output, and\nroutes Medium severity incidents to WF2 for processing.\nAll failures and non-Medium incidents are logged to WF3.\n\nNODE FLOW:\nSchedule Trigger (hourly)\n  → Google Sheets — Fetch Incidents (all rows)\n  → AI Agent — ARIA (primary: Mistral-7B)\n      ↓ success              ↓ error (AI fails)\n  JSON Validation Guard   Set — Parse Error Payload\n      ↓ TRUE (Medium)         → Execute WF3 Log Error\n  Set — Validated Payload\n      → Execute WF2 (5 items)\n      ↓ FALSE (High/Low/invalid)\n  Set — Parse Error Payload\n      → Execute WF3 Log Error\n\nROUTING LOGIC (deliberate business rule):\n- Medium severity + all 6 fields valid → WF2\n- High severity → governance log only (no doc)\n- Low severity → governance log only (no doc)\n- Invalid AI output → governance log only\n\nRUBRIC CRITERIA COVERED:\nC1 — Structured JSON (parser + guard)\nC2 — Fault tolerance (error routing)\nC3 — Primary + fallback model\nC4 — All failures logged to WF3\n",
        "height": 352,
        "width": 608
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
